{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026O9CIVQQDu51785289805.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">粉嶺有鐵皮屋起火，一名男子死亡，70多人疏散。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.FL-0930.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20260sIsJsaR691785289829.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.FL-0930.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">發生火警的鐵皮屋位於靈山路附近，現場火光熊熊，濃煙四散，鐵皮屋多處被熏黑。火警救熄後，消防繼續射水降溫。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方凌晨四時許，接獲多人報案指有火警。火警在約一小時後救熄，現場發現一名50多歲男子當場證實死亡，死因有待調查。一名12歲女童報稱頭暈不適送院。初步調查，懷疑起火單位電線短路引致火警。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T01:58:27.184720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}